{1}{Greetings.  I've heard the bad news about the negotiations...I blame myself as much as you.  I suppose we'll have to draft a new proposal, and send in a different mediator.  In any case, thank you for your time.  [He seems a bit stand-offish, but extends his hand.]  I wish you the best of luck in the future...}{Greetings.  I've heard the bad news about the negotiations...I blame myself as much as you.  I suppose we'll have to draft a new proposal, and send in a different mediator.  In any case, thank you for your time.  [He seems a bit stand-offish, but extends his hand.]  I wish you the best of luck in the future...}{}{}{}{}
