{32}{I don't like what you're insinuating, Willoughsby...}{}{5}{}{39}{}
{35}{Perhaps it was my mistake in thinking you had the characteristics of a skilled mediator.  I blame myself for this situation, and for your failure.  Still, you did best with the limited mental faculties at your disposal.  I can't with good conscience train you to be a Master in persuasion, but I'll pay you 3000 gold pieces for your troubles...[He hands is to you.]}{Perhaps it was my mistake in thinking you had the characteristics of a skilled mediator.  I blame myself for this situation, and for your failure.  Still, you did best with the limited mental faculties at your disposal.  I can't with good conscience train you to be a Master in persuasion, but I'll pay you 3000 gold pieces for your troubles...[He hands is to you.]}{}{}{}{qu1098 4}
