{39}{Really?  Well I'm sorry you're offended, but the incompetence you've shown here has offended me, and put the Unified Kingdom in a bad position.  You will NOT be trained as a Master in persuasion, you'll be given 3000 gold pieces for your trouble, and I'll hear no more of your threats...}{Really?  Well I'm sorry you're offended, but the incompetence you've shown here has offended me, and put the Unified Kingdom in a bad position.  You will NOT be trained as a Master in persuasion, you'll be given 3000 gold pieces for your trouble, and I'll hear no more of your threats...}{}{}{}{}
